<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Rajhi Banking nine-month net rises 12.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Saudi Rajhi Banking nine-month net rises 12.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (billion Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		     901.7 million   vs  802.6 million</p>
<p> Operating expenses	   687.1 million   vs  636.5 million</p>
<p> Operating income		 1.59	    vs    1.44</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity	   5.35	    vs    4.89</p>
<p> Assets			    33.27	    vs   30.58</p>
<p>Full Name: Al-Rajhi Banking and Investment Corporation</p>
<p>Note- The Jeddah-based bank enjoys a good reputation among ordinary Saudis due to its stated commitment to Islamic law, which bans payment and receipt of interest.</p>
</text>
